@startuml overview
!include theme.iuml
title Crafty — deployment and isolation boundaries
top to bottom direction

actor "Maker\ncaliper + object" as User
component "Browser\nReact chat + capture / annotation\ninline images, forms, Three.js models" as Web
node "DigitalOcean host · Docker Compose" {
  component "Caddy · public edge\nicrafty.ai · HTTPS / WSS" as Edge
  node "Application boundary · trusted Python / uv" #E8F3EC {
    component "API + coordinator\nsole domain state owner\nasset ingestion / revision publication" as API
    database "Metadata + durable events\nSQLite first" as DB
    storage "Immutable blobs\nprivate API volume first" as Blobs
  }
  node "Agent boundary · one project / owner" #FFF0E5 {
    component "Python ACP supervisor\n-> Codex ACP adapter (ACP v1 stdio)\n-> Codex App Server (native stdio)" as Agent
    component "Crafty MCP facade · local stdio\nasset_fetch -> localPath\nasset_publish / model_publish(path)\nrequest input · isolated CAD build" as MCP
    storage "Chat scratch directories\nprivate agent home + credentials" as Work
    note bottom of Work
      No app DB, global blobs,
      host workspace, or Docker socket.
    end note
  }
  component "Trusted CAD launcher\nfixed images / entrypoints / job mounts\nonly component with container control" as Launcher #E8F3EC
  node "Disposable execution boundary · each job attempt" #FCE9E7 {
    component "Build container\nFreeCAD executes generated Python" as CAD
    component "Isolated verification / preview\nreopen submitted STEP -> GLB -> PNG\nnever execute generated Python" as Verify
    note bottom of Verify
      No network, credentials, or Docker socket.
      Unprivileged; read-only root; dropped caps.
      CPU / RAM / PID / disk / time limits.
      Only frozen inputs + bounded job outputs.
    end note
  }
}
cloud "Model / enabled image services" as Provider

User --> Web
Web --> Edge : commands / uploads / downloads\napplication event stream + cursor
Edge --> API
API -right-> DB : transaction + event
DB -down[hidden]-> Blobs
API -[norank]-> Blobs : finalize bytes
API --> Agent : private scoped channel\ndispatch / acknowledged events
Agent --> MCP : tool calls
Agent -right-> Provider : provider egress
MCP --> Work : materialize / publish bytes
MCP -[norank]-> API : scoped domain HTTP\nasset / operation IDs
API --> Launcher : lease / inputs / guarded completion\nlauncher initiates private connection
Launcher --> CAD : create / stop / destroy
CAD --> Verify : build -> local file handoff -> model_publish\nseparate verification job (logical lifecycle)
Verify -[norank]-> Launcher : validated output set
Agent -[hidden]right-> Launcher
legend bottom
  Green: trusted state / orchestration   Orange: agent runtime   Red: generated-code execution
  Private arrows describe logical exchange; only Caddy has public routes.
  Agent and local MCP share a file namespace. Worker paths require explicit transfer.
  Printing is a future additional MCP integration; current product ends at downloads.
  Design proposal; services are not deployed yet. Protocol detail: acp-turn diagram.
endlegend
@enduml
